    q: 'A SMART drive warning appears in the OS notification area. What is the MOST appropriate immediate response?',
    a: [['a','Ignore it; SMART warnings are often false positives'],['b','Run chkdsk immediately to repair any errors'],['c','Back up the drive\'s data and plan for drive replacement',true],['d','Reformat the drive to clear SMART errors']],
